/P 79 0 R
/E (Next, teachers help students establish team roles, which may rotate throughout the project: Builder, Programmer, Tester, and Documenter. LEGO kits and building guides are distributed. Teams construct a basic robot chassis \(the taxi model\) equipped with motors, while teachers circulate to assist with any technical difficulties. Once construction is complete, teams store their robots safely.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
endobj
